# A load through the PS link, as the SD menu does it (M7 step 7.10; Makefile
# ci-arty-snes, the krom picture's ROM in the harness's DDR): part way into
# frame 3 (wait counts microseconds, a frame is 16.7 ms) the PS holds the
# machine, writes the cartridge word (LoROM, 32 KiB: bytes 0C 00 at
# Snes.Machine.cartAddr; 16 bits since step 7.11) and lets go. The machine must start afresh on the
# ROM: its picture once faded in (frame 20 on, every frame the same) is the
# golden; PS_IN must say system 9.
wait 44000
hold 1
wait 200
bytes 0 0C00
wait 100
hold 0
